					"蘭非拉"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730391224,
					"content": "#嗯，還是得{NICKNAME}幫幫忙才行，不然又會做出和之前一樣的菜餚呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391201
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391201,
					"content": "依照之前派蒙想到的改善方式，指導蘭那羅將菜餚完成了。\\n隨後，和蘭那羅一起享用…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730391202,
					"content": "怎麼樣？正宗的那菈美食！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391203,
					"content": "#唔…雖然是蘭帕卡提提議，讓那菈{NICKNAME}來指導哥哥們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391204,
					"content": "那菈的菜…這、這就是那菈的「快樂的味道」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391205,
					"content": "快樂都要逃走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391206,
					"content": "桓那蘭那的水…明明是「最好喝的水」…怎麼會煮出這種東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391207,
					"content": "但是「鮮嫩無朋之果」還是一樣好吃…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭非拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391208,
					"content": "欸？怎麼會這樣？蘭那羅都覺得難吃嗎？我覺得很美味啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391209,
					"content": "雖然不知道什麼是「難吃」…唔…很有「衝擊力」的味道，像跑得太快撞到樹幹上一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391210,
					"content": "哇…這…這一定是那菈文化和蘭那羅文化的碰撞！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391211,
					"content": "#不過，哥哥們，真不好。你們要謝謝那菈{NICKNAME}才對，怎麼能說這些話！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391212,
					"content": "嗚嗚…對不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391213,
					"content": "不是啦！要說謝謝！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391214,
					"content": "#謝謝那菈{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391215,
					"content": "#不過…那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙吃得開心，就好！不管那些笨蛋哥哥。只要那菈朋友開心，我們就很開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391216,
					"content": "#不過，那菈{NICKNAME}和那菈法留納，一點也不一樣。那菈法留納，那時候說了好多「{M#哥哥}{F#妹妹}」的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391217,
					"content": "#但是，那菈{NICKNAME}說話很少。不舒服？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391218,
					"content": "#唔…{NICKNAME}，說點什麼吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391219,
						730391220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391219,
					"content": "謝謝關心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391222
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730391222,
					"content": "#是這樣嗎？既然那菈{NICKNAME}沒事就好。嗯，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。這些小花，是蘭帕卡提和哥哥們，送給那菈{NICKNAME}還有派蒙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391223,
					"content": "#希望那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，在桓那蘭那得到更多「快樂的味道」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭帕卡提"
				},
				{
					"id": 730391220,
					"content": "（保持沉默）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730391221,
					"content": "#…總之，蘭帕卡提不用擔心！{NICKNAME}沒問題的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730391222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
